  "details": "Currently if you kick a group member it notifies them of the kick. I think this enables harassment and group owners should have a choice on whether or not they want to notify the kicked party or not.\n\nThis is especially relevant under current circumstances where you can't delete a group without kicking every member first. If you ever purge a large group because you want to delete it to make room for new groups you have to expect some fallout for it, and I don't think that should be the case.",
